# Description           :       This is the script to Undelete data in table at Undelete mode.
# Input                 :       userId, crncyCode
# Output                :       None
# Called Script         :       None
# Calling Script        :       hdenommn005.scr
#
# Modification History
# Sl. #           Date             Author             Modification           Version
